1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:02,719
This is the Hakimi job search website I created using AI.

2
00:00:02,719 --> 00:00:04,339
The initial version still has a strong AI vibe

3
00:00:04,339 --> 00:00:06,239
but after optimization, it instantly transforms into a dopamine-inducing style

4
00:00:06,239 --> 00:00:09,099
and have compiled it into a step-by-step tutorial to share with you

5
00:00:09,099 --> 00:00:10,399
It is recommended to like and favorite it first

6
00:00:10,399 --> 00:00:13,220
so you won't have trouble finding it when needed

7
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:15,480
This time we'll directly use Claudecode to create the webpage

8
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,520
Open ClaudeCode and upload Mi's resume

9
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:19,640
generate a job-seeking website based on the resume

10
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:21,720
we get a classic blue-purple color scheme

11
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:23,720
cookie-cutter AI assembly line website

12
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:24,240
Don't worry

13
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:26,500
Next, we'll gradually adjust it to a dopamine style.

14
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:27,780
The first step is to build the framework

15
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:30,500
Because AI's replication capability far surpasses its imaginative power

16
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:31,380
before writing the code

17
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:33,380
You can first build a framework on this website

18
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:35,420
page layout, where to place buttons and images

19
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:36,540
first get it clear

20
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:37,580
then upload the image

21
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:39,320
Tell the AI 'Write according to this structure'

22
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:41,060
we get a webpage like this

23
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:44,620
However, the current color scheme and typography still lack aesthetic appeal and consistency.

24
00:00:44,620 --> 00:00:47,120
We can use Nano banana to unify the website color scheme

25
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:48,040
upload reference image

26
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:50,240
Then generate a color palette based on this image

27
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:53,800
Then let the AI pre-define the spacing and typographic hierarchy of this webpage

28
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:55,160
maintain page consistency

29
00:00:55,160 --> 00:00:56,780
There is also a skill on GitHub

30
00:00:56,780 --> 00:00:59,120
specifically designed to make our webpage stand out

31
00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:00,440
Combine these three techniques

32
00:01:00,440 --> 00:01:01,840
after several rounds of fine-tuning

33
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:04,060
we can obtain a dopamine-style webpage

34
00:01:04,060 --> 00:01:05,920
During fine-tuning, use screenshots for communication whenever possible

35
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:06,940
do not use typing

36
00:01:06,940 --> 00:01:09,060
The more visual information we provide to the AI

37
00:01:09,060 --> 00:01:10,640
the more stable its understanding becomes

38
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:13,320
For example, this is the text and rounded-corner style I want

39
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:14,979
upload the screenshot, and ClaudeCode instantly understands

40
00:01:14,979 --> 00:01:16,659
This is much better than using a prompt

41
00:01:16,659 --> 00:01:18,279
say 'make the font on the webpage look good'

42
00:01:18,279 --> 00:01:20,139
The conveyed content is much clearer.

43
00:01:20,139 --> 00:01:21,610
To summarize again

44
00:01:21,610 --> 00:01:23,490
To make the AI-generated page look good

45
00:01:23,490 --> 00:01:25,160
you need to understand at least these 2 principles

46
00:01:25,160 --> 00:01:27,600
First, build the webpage framework and unify the visual style

47
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:28,300
then write the code

48
00:01:28,300 --> 00:01:30,840
Second, use screenshots as the primary method of communication with AI.

49
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:32,340
Did you learn it?

50
00:01:32,340 --> 00:01:33,540
Welcome to the Triple Combo

51
00:01:33,540 --> 00:01:35,280
Explore the fascinating world of AI

